id: experienced-fighter-second-effect
name: 2nd effect of Experienced Fighter
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerTier: 3
attacking: false
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: experienced-fighter
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Experienced Fighter's second effect, as a Maneuver: 3(T) Ki Points at an Opponent - Exploitation Strike, Instinct-Driven Dodge or Punishing Blow.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you can spend 3(T) Ki Points to target an Opponent and apply one of the following effects (these effects cannot stack): Exploitation Strike, Instinct-Driven Dodge, Punishing Blow.

---

# The Liquid State's sixth effect's shape (liquid-sixth-effect.dbu): owned by every character, in the list only while
# Experienced Fighter is had (`fromTrait`). Used, which of the three is asked (chat.mjs experiencedFighter).
[on used]
experiencedFighter();
